---
/*
  Arm-early / deadline-late timeline for the HIL case study.
  Wide by nature, so it scrolls horizontally inside its own box on phones
  instead of shrinking the labels to nothing.
*/
---

<figure class="timing">
  <div class="timing-scroll">
    <svg
      viewBox="0 0 760 250"
      role="img"
      aria-labelledby="timing-title timing-desc"
      class="timing-svg"
    >
      <title id="timing-title">Arm early, deadline late</title>
      <desc id="timing-desc">
        All expectations are armed before the stimulus starts. Deadlines start when the test sequence reaches
        them. Expectation A's event arrives during the stimulus and is still captured. Expectation B's event
        arrives inside its window and its latency is taken at arrival. Expectation C's event arrives after its
        deadline and is reported as missed.
      </desc>

      <!-- guides -->
      <line x1="100" y1="22" x2="100" y2="206" class="guide" />
      <line x1="280" y1="22" x2="280" y2="206" class="guide" />
      <text x="100" y="16" class="guide-label" text-anchor="middle">all armed</text>
      <text x="280" y="16" class="guide-label" text-anchor="middle">deadlines start</text>

      <!-- row labels -->
      <text x="12" y="54" class="row-label">Stimulus</text>
      <text x="12" y="99" class="row-label">Expect A</text>
      <text x="12" y="139" class="row-label">Expect B</text>
      <text x="12" y="179" class="row-label">Expect C</text>

      <!-- stimulus -->
      <rect x="100" y="38" width="180" height="24" rx="4" class="stimulus" />
      <text x="190" y="54" class="bar-label" text-anchor="middle">e.g. hold a fault 3 s</text>

      <!-- A: window after the stimulus, event arrived during it -->
      <rect x="280" y="84" width="100" height="22" rx="4" class="window" />
      <circle cx="180" cy="95" r="6" class="met" />
      <text x="570" y="99" class="note">caught mid-stimulus → MET</text>

      <!-- B: event inside its window -->
      <rect x="280" y="124" width="240" height="22" rx="4" class="window" />
      <circle cx="450" cy="135" r="6" class="met" />
      <text x="570" y="139" class="note">MET, latency taken at arrival</text>

      <!-- C: event after its window -->
      <rect x="280" y="164" width="140" height="22" rx="4" class="window" />
      <circle cx="480" cy="175" r="6" class="missed" />
      <text x="570" y="179" class="note">late → MISSED, not "seen"</text>

      <!-- axis -->
      <line x1="90" y1="214" x2="555" y2="214" class="axis" />
      <path d="M555 209 L563 214 L555 219 Z" class="axis-head" />
      <text x="563" y="232" class="guide-label" text-anchor="end">time</text>

      <!-- legend -->
      <rect x="100" y="228" width="14" height="10" rx="2" class="window" />
      <text x="120" y="237" class="legend">deadline window</text>
      <circle cx="240" cy="233" r="5" class="met" />
      <text x="250" y="237" class="legend">met</text>
      <circle cx="290" cy="233" r="5" class="missed" />
      <text x="300" y="237" class="legend">missed</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    Every expectation is armed before the stimulus; each deadline starts when the sequence reaches it.
    <span class="scroll-hint">Scroll sideways to see the whole timeline.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .timing {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .timing-scroll {
    overflow-x: auto;
    border: 1px solid rgba(100, 116, 139, 0.4);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7);
    padding: 0.75rem;
  }

  .timing-svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 640px;
    height: auto;
    font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
  }

  figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: rgb(148, 163, 184);
  }

  .scroll-hint {
    display: none;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .scroll-hint {
      display: inline;
    }
  }

  .guide {
    stroke: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.5);
    stroke-width: 1;
    stroke-dasharray: 4 4;
  }

  .guide-label,
  .legend {
    fill: rgb(148, 163, 184);
    font-size: 11px;
  }

  .row-label {
    fill: rgb(203, 213, 225);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .bar-label {
    fill: rgb(236, 254, 255);
    font-size: 11px;
  }

  .note {
    fill: rgb(226, 232, 240);
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .stimulus {
    fill: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.25);
    stroke: rgb(34, 211, 238);
  }

  .window {
    fill: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.22);
    stroke: rgb(192, 132, 252);
  }

  .met {
    fill: rgb(74, 222, 128);
  }

  .missed {
    fill: rgb(248, 113, 113);
  }

  .axis {
    stroke: rgb(148, 163, 184);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .axis-head {
    fill: rgb(148, 163, 184);
  }
</style>
